{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"は～い（＾ω＾）\n皆 おつかれたま❤️\nまひろ と まいやんだよ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2014/12/30/0237855/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近 本当に寒いけど皆大丈夫かな？\n手洗いうがいはしっかりするんだよ～（＾ω＾）❤️"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"￣￣￣￣￣￣￣￣￣￣"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日曜日は京都にて今年最後の個別握手会でした.\nその時のまに私服がこちら.＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2014/12/30/0237855/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ワンピース.＊ カラータイツ.．"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆にいっぱい褒めてもらえた～（＾ω＾） わ～ 嬉しいね❤️"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2014/12/30/0237855/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じっ❤️"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2014/12/30/0237855/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"デザインが本当にお気に入り。\nワンピースの中は エリがシルバーでいい感じの白のシャツを合わせました.＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2014/12/30/0237855/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どう？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2014/12/30/0237855/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これどこの国かなあ？？？\n本当 最高❤️ この絵の中に入り込みたい（＾ω＾）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういえばまだ海外に行ったことがない。\nみんなはオススメの国とかあるかな？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして京都の握手会に来てくれた皆さん、本当にありがとう❤️\n沢山の方とまた会えて,いっぱい握手できて嬉しかったです(o^^o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会まだ来たことないって方も 是非遊びに来てね～.＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まに．ちー．あみ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2014/12/30/0237855/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まに．ちー．あみ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2014/12/30/0237855/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"￣￣￣￣￣￣￣￣￣￣"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃあ～こんな写真でも載せよっかな。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなみの髪セット中...笑\n(マネージャーさん撮影)❤️\nすごい！ いっぱいピンささってた。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2014/12/30/0237855/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごい！\nこんな形の箱初めて見た（＾ω＾）わら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2014/12/30/0237855/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カーナビ『乃木坂46navi』が発売中です！！！\n本当にオススメです（＾ν＾）\n私もカーナビ選抜なので是非使ってみてくださいね❤️"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よろしくお願いします（＾ω＾）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年ももうすぐ終わりだね！\n頑張ろうね.＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まに,"}],"source":"archive"}